<title>POLAND: Exbud wins PLN 28.4 mln deal.</title>
<headline>Exbud wins PLN 28.4 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Exbud SA has won a 28.4-million-zloty contract to build a shopping centre for the Polish unit of Dutch Macro Cash and Carry supermarket chain, Exbud said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exbud said the works would be carried out by August 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
